data: {"id": "83770725358c4f65-thinking-parallel_evidence-1375", "run_id": "83770725358c4f65", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突与缺口说明：\n\n### 实体\n- **Pod**: `workload`，命名空间 `aiops-case-v01`\n- **生命周期**: 持续处于 `Pending` 阶段（已存在 3 分 42 秒），无 `deletionTimestamp`，无重启（`RESTARTS: 0`）。\n\n### 已验证事实（支持 PendingUnschedulable）\n1. **调度事件直接归因于 CPU 资源不足**: `kubectl_events` 与 `kubectl_describe` 均返回相同事件：\n   `FailedScheduling: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod..`\n   这直接证实了 Pod 无法被调度的核心原因是 **集群节点 CPU 资源不足**。\n\n2. **节点可用性与容量**: `kubectl get nodes` ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 9, "ts_ms": 1789104718569, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

